asm (below) so it is correct the moment 459a completes; it is landed ahead of reachability exactly like the
project's other asm-verified CF-fold reconstructions (patch 073's unexercised dispatch block, etc.).  It is
BEHAVIOUR-NEUTRAL for every current path (e4bb has no live caller yet), so verify stays 19/19.

